;   4. MaxHoldBars 20 (give winners room on M15)
;   5. MaxDailyLossPct 5% (hard daily stop)
;   6. Graduated exit cuts losers early, extends winners
;   7. Profit lock banks gains when trade gives back from 1R+
;   8. Volume scales down 25% per consecutive loss
;
; Magic 7788075 — fleet exposure guard compliant.
